WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.269
Want to show off a build? Create a Graphic
turns your roster into a shareable image

2
00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:04.801
in seconds.

3
00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:13.217
Pick Build card and a character. My Build
uses exactly what you saved in My Roster,

4
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:14.779
so there's nothing to type.

5
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:21.626
Switch to Guide Example for PawPixl's
example build. It's labelled on the card, so

6
00:00:21.676 --> 00:00:23.321
nobody mistakes it for your own.

7
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:30.370
Then Choose a template... Showcase is
made for sharing, and Detailed build shows

8
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:35.071
every piece and stat. Anything you haven't
saved shows as missing, never invented.

9
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.697
Pick a size, vertical, square or
landscape, and choose what to show, like

10
00:00:40.747 --> 00:00:42.401
constellation, level or stats.

11
00:00:43.967 --> 00:00:48.992
Team cards work the same way. Any numbers
on a team card are modelled estimates, not

12
00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:49.536
team DPS.

13
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:56.671
Then download the PNG, or copy the image.
Cards are made in your browser, and only

14
00:00:56.721 --> 00:01:00.321
show build details and pawpixl.com,
never your UID or email.

15
00:01:02.867 --> 00:01:05.557
now go show off that build
Traveler! See you around!
